    "1.18.2":{
        "1.18.2-2.1.15":"API: many changes related to Tags and worldgen/regen\r\nPorted to Minecraft 1.18.2\r\nUpdated Forge version to 40.0.12\r\nUpdated CC:Tweaked version to 1.100.3\r\nUpdated Patchouli version to 1.18.2-66\r\nUpdated JEI version to 9.4.3.123\r\nBumped version to 2.1.15"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.1.16":"- Fix multiblock assembly in corer cases before opt2 is merged in\r\n- Updated Forge to version 40.1.0\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.100.4\r\n- Updated JEI to version 9.7.0.100\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.16"
