        "1.21.1-2.4.11":"- Fix loading of er_gui_theme.json. Closes #172\r\n- Added back Patchouli support\r\n- Book: added a section for the Energizer and a new introductory text\r\n- Book: refined the old pages a bit\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.21-87\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.11\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.11"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.12":"- Fixed recipes of the in-game book. Closes #179\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.12"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.13":"- Fix particles on rotor shaft and blade blocks. Closes #174\r\n- Added a model fallback to be used when (Neo)Forge cannot supply the correct ModelData during quad or particle requests (see https://github.com/neoforged/NeoForge/issues/1629)\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 1.21.1-2.4.13\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.13"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.14":"- New low-poly Turbine Rotor model for better shader compatibility\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.14"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.15":"- Added the Energizer Active FE Power Port block. In output mode, it supplies energy to any Forge Energy-compatible block. Closes #182\r\n- Tweaked energy distribution to exclude all passive and input ports\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.15"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.16":"- Allows empty fluid stacks to be saved in a Fuel Injection Port in item form. Closes #183\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.14\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.16"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.17":"- Split render properties away from ReactorFluidType to avoid side-related issues\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.17"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.18":"- Added Deepslate Yellorite Ore to the c:ores tag\r\n- Split render properties away from Steam too\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.18"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.19":"- Reactors and Turbines don't reset statistical data anymore at the start of the tick, which provided occasional incorrect data from the Computer APIs\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.19"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.20":"- Changed the min/max values of the global/reactor/turbine power production multiplier to 0.005 / 100.0\r\n- Changed the max capacity of the reactor/turbine energy buffers to scale with the power production multipliers in the same way as energy production is.\r\n- Fixed energy buffer capacity not correctly reported in the Reactor Controller GUI\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.20"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.21":"- Fixed crash related to an empty FuelRodMap. Closes #192\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.21"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.22":"- Removed unneeded data compoments from Reprocessor / Fluidizer recipes. Closes #198\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.17\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.22"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.23":"- Added compatibility with Create 6.0.6\r\n- Updated JEI to version 19.21.0.247\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.21-88\r\n- Updated Mekanism to version 10.7.9.72\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.115.1\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.18\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.1.152\r\n- Updated gradle to version 8.10\r\n- Updated NeoGradle to version 7.0.183\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.23"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.24":"- The Reactor computer method getControlRodLocation() now correctly return the Control Rod location as a map\r\n- Added some missing item tags for yellorite / deepslate yellorite\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.24"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.25":"- Reactors, Turbines and Energizers now don't turn themself off when the multiblock is disassambled (by the player or by chunk unloading) keeping their last know state when a save is reloaded. Closes #205\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.25"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.26":"- Added simplified Chinese localization (by ZH)\r\n- Added Turkish localization (by RuyaSavascisi)\r\n- Added Japanese localization (by twister716)\r\n- Updated Portuguese (Brazil) localization (by PrincessStellar)\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.26"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.27":"- Raised max extraction rate for Reactors/Turbines Power Ports from 5 MFE/t to 50 MFE/t\r\n- Raised max charge rate for Reactors/Turbines Charging Ports from 5 KFE/t to 25 KFE/t\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.27"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.28":"- Stop multiblocks from keeping chunks loaded more then necessary\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.21\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.28"
	},
    "1.21.4":{
        "1.21.4-2.4.19":"- BETA VERSION\r\n- Updated Minecraft to version 1.21.4\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.4.51-beta\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 1.21.4-2.4.15\r\n- Bumped version to 1.21.4-2.4.19"
		,
        "1.21.4-2.4.20":"- Patched reload listeners registration after NeoForge changes caused issues.\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.4.97-beta\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.16\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.20"
    },
